menu "Node 1 Pump Configuration"

    config NODE1_RELAY_GPIO
        int "GPIO number connected to relay IN pin"
        range 0 39
        default 23
        help
            GPIO ESP32 DevKit yang terhubung ke pin IN modul relay.
            Rekomendasi: 23. Hindari strapping pins 0, 2, 5, 12, 15
            (GPIO15 = MTDO, mempengaruhi boot log ESP32 classic).

    config NODE1_RELAY_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "Relay module is active-LOW (IN low = relay ON)"
        default y
        help
            Banyak modul relay 1-channel murah active-LOW.
            Default ini mengikuti sketch Arduino lama Node 1
            (RELAY_ACTIVE_LOW true). Jika pompa terbalik perilakunya
            (ON saat harusnya OFF), matikan opsi ini di menuconfig.

    config NODE1_RESTORE_ONOFF_AFTER_REBOOT
        bool "Restore last pump state after reboot"
        default n
        help
            Nonaktif (default, fail-safe): pompa selalu OFF setelah
            boot/power-loss/restart, state mesh & NVS disinkronkan ke OFF.
            Aktif: pompa kembali ke state OnOff terakhir yang tersimpan
            di NVS (untuk kontinuitas jadwal irigasi).

endmenu
